---
import ContentPageLayout from '../layouts/ContentPageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/constants';
---
<ContentPageLayout
  title="About MiniAdda"
  description="MiniAdda publishes short, sourced answers to the questions everyone is asking."
  heading="About MiniAdda"
  crumb="About"
>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is a fast, focused information site. Instead of long, padded articles, we give you
    a clear answer near the top, a short explanation, and links to the sources we used — then get
    out of your way.
  </p>
  <p>
    We cover the questions people actually search for: who won an election, what the latest product
    is, why a market moved, who owns a company, and similar everyday questions across politics,
    technology, business, finance, entertainment, science, sports and general knowledge.
  </p>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <p>
    Every article is reviewed by an editor before it is published. We state what is known, mark what
    is uncertain, and update answers when the facts change. Each answer shows a <em>last verified</em>
    date so you know how current it is.
  </p>

  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We don't invent authors, quotes, reviews or citations.</li>
    <li>We don't publish unverified claims as fact.</li>
    <li>We don't pad answers to chase word counts.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Read our <a href="/editorial">Editorial Policy</a> for the full standard, or
    <a href="/contact">contact us</a> with a correction.
  </p>
</ContentPageLayout>
